  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9486c91f63d03b93",
      "translationZh": "昨天，我在 WeAreDevelopers World Congress North America 上发表了闭幕主题演讲。为了打造一个 STAR 时刻，我决定在演讲中穿插提及 2026 年我们迎来的破纪录的鸮鹦鹉繁殖季。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4819586a41389b5",
      "translationZh": "我想用最后一张幻灯片来庆祝一番，而且我看到了一些热议，说 Claude Opus 5.5 制作像素艺术动画的能力非常出色。于是，我从 Google 图片搜索中找了三张鸮鹦鹉照片，把它们放进 Claude，并附上这段提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "496e58722e9e558f",
      "translationZh": "这里有几张鸮鹦鹉的照片，只是提醒你它们长什么样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b15eb528bc1c36c0",
      "translationZh": "我需要你在 HTML 5 canvas 上制作一段像素艺术动画，让一群明显采用像素艺术风格的鸮鹦鹉上下蹦跳，开着派对，还有彩纸屑之类的东西——鸮鹦鹉至少要有 20 只。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4ace536a28dcfef",
      "translationZh": "这是对话记录，这是生成的页面。效果相当棒！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2c6b991edce39a9",
      "translationZh": "我想把它嵌入一个 Keynote 演示文稿文件中，于是下载了 HTML，并对本地的 Claude Code 会话说：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdd523d4c1a281dc",
      "translationZh": "帮我把 file:///Users/simon/Downloads/kakapo-party.html 制作成视频——你需要在浏览器中加载它，并点击几次以触发彩纸屑效果，视频长度应为 15 秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e2b2e2859e93a6a",
      "translationZh": "到第 3 秒再开始点击。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1a440d4cbea5982",
      "translationZh": "确保多次点击分散在可点击区域的不同位置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c4cd37e2f2fa23f",
      "translationZh": "Claude Code 使用了 Playwright（操作记录见此处），并生成了这段视频，正好满足我最后一张幻灯片的需要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f779d26e03db2a2a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持 HTML5 视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd631e21a3050d0e",
      "translationZh": "以下是它使用的完整 Playwright 脚本，简短得令人欣喜：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
